(1834013, 252495, 45790, '<td valign="top">Appealing and busy. Might be improved with some fill flash or somehow blocking the backlighting in the upper left corner.</td>', 'Appealing and busy. Might be improved with some fill flash or somehow blocking the backlighting in the upper left corner.', '2005-11-02 17:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
