(1835904, 250527, 46045, '<td valign="top">i love this. minimalistic and yet so strong.</td>', 'i love this. minimalistic and yet so strong.', '2005-11-03 12:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1835906, 252336, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent entry!  Reminds me of the Basilica in Old Montreal (but it''s not that one).  I think you have a winner here :)</td>', 'Excellent entry!  Reminds me of the Basilica in Old Montreal (but it''s not that one).  I think you have a winner here :)', '2005-11-03 12:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1835908, 251287, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good entry for "busy".  IMO, this particular take would need to be very sharp to be totally effective, and it isn''t.  Also, it would be nice if the sky were not so light.  Lastly, I am wondering if you tried a vertical (more street less building at the sides)? (7)</td>', 'Good entry for "busy".  IMO, this particular take would need to be very sharp to be totally effective, and it isn''t.  Also, it would be nice if the sky were not so light.  Lastly, I am wondering if you tried a vertical (more street less building at the sides)? (7)', '2005-11-03 12:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1835909, 249864, 47184, '<td valign="top">there are so much bug photos in this competition!</td>', 'there are so much bug photos in this competition!', '2005-11-03 12:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1835911, 250510, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, reminds me flying in/out of Denver, mountains to the West, square fields to the East.  It probably is not Denver though (so much green?).  In a funny way, this makes me think more of "peaceful" than "busy".  It is a beautiful photo though.  (8)</td>', 'Beautiful shot, reminds me flying in/out of Denver, mountains to the West, square fields to the East.  It probably is not Denver though (so much green?).  In a funny way, this makes me think more of "peaceful" than "busy".  It is a beautiful photo though.  (8)', '2005-11-03 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1835913, 252071, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.  IMHO, maybe if the model were not so centred it would work a bit better?  Something to try.</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.  IMHO, maybe if the model were not so centred it would work a bit better?  Something to try.', '2005-11-03 12:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1835915, 251829, 5112, '<td valign="top">or, so many footprints, so little time.  Good take on the challenge, excellent composition, love square crop.  Reminds me of a jjbeguin.  (8)</td>', 'or, so many footprints, so little time.  Good take on the challenge, excellent composition, love square crop.  Reminds me of a jjbeguin.  (8)', '2005-11-03 12:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1835924, 252142, 5112, '<td valign="top">Lovely candid!  Good entry to "busy".  They have just the right expression, I betcha if you asked them a question at this moment, they''d answer, "Yes, Mom (or Dad)!" without ever hearing your question.<br/> <br/>From a technical point, there is that "blown out" area to the right, and it is somewhat distracting; it would also be nice if the light were more even between the three faces.  (7)</td>', 'Lovely candid!  Good entry to "busy".  They have just the right expression, I betcha if you asked them a question at this moment, they''d answer, "Yes, Mom (or Dad)!" without ever hearing your question. From a technical point, there is that "blown out" area to the right, and it is somewhat distracting; it would also be nice if the light were more even between the three faces.  (7)', '2005-11-03 12:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1835930, 250984, 42135, '<td valign="top">There is too much out of focus and not enough of the waterdragon showing.</td>', 'There is too much out of focus and not enough of the waterdragon showing.', '2005-11-03 12:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
