(1836166, 251931, 44860, '<td valign="top">Cool... I am not a fan of these industrial landscapes, but this photo is interesting - sharpness of buildings contrasts nicely with softness of steam/smoke...8</td>', 'Cool... I am not a fan of these industrial landscapes, but this photo is interesting - sharpness of buildings contrasts nicely with softness of steam/smoke...8', '2005-11-03 15:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
