(1836407, 252154, 42845, '<td valign="top">A little too contrasty for my taste, but really good eye to take note of and capture that.  I like it.  7</td>', 'A little too contrasty for my taste, but really good eye to take note of and capture that.  I like it.  7', '2005-11-03 17:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836413, 252439, 42845, '<td valign="top">I like your image, but I''m not sure it''s busy enough for me.  The lines of the bridge -- which indeed make the photo beautiful -- are very linear, and to me don''t add busyness.</td>', 'I like your image, but I''m not sure it''s busy enough for me.  The lines of the bridge -- which indeed make the photo beautiful -- are very linear, and to me don''t add busyness.', '2005-11-03 17:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836415, 252417, 42845, '<td valign="top">The color seems off.  Supersaturated?  But I like your idea.</td>', 'The color seems off.  Supersaturated?  But I like your idea.', '2005-11-03 17:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836420, 252092, 42845, '<td valign="top">Bad pirate.  (He is a pirate, isn''t he?)  I like the spontaneity.</td>', 'Bad pirate.  (He is a pirate, isn''t he?)  I like the spontaneity.', '2005-11-03 17:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836422, 250438, 42845, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture of the fountain.  The framing cuts in a little bit, and the time stamp is distracting.</td>', 'Very cool capture of the fountain.  The framing cuts in a little bit, and the time stamp is distracting.', '2005-11-03 17:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836423, 250409, 42845, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, but too much post-processing for me.</td>', 'Nice landscape, but too much post-processing for me.', '2005-11-03 17:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836427, 250715, 42845, '<td valign="top">Too much post-processing for me.   You lose what I imagine is a really nice picture.</td>', 'Too much post-processing for me.   You lose what I imagine is a really nice picture.', '2005-11-03 17:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836429, 252140, 42845, '<td valign="top">I like that you took a chance, but I think you could have spread your wings a little more and taken that chance on something more challenging.</td>', 'I like that you took a chance, but I think you could have spread your wings a little more and taken that chance on something more challenging.', '2005-11-03 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836435, 252436, 42845, '<td valign="top">I think your picture is really well done, but, at the same time, it''s also been done in too similar a way for me. 6</td>', 'I think your picture is really well done, but, at the same time, it''s also been done in too similar a way for me. 6', '2005-11-03 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836441, 249741, 42845, '<td valign="top">Very stylized.  I like it.  A little too saturated for my eyes, even in its stylization.  But I really like that you had a sort of fine-art vision in mind.</td>', 'Very stylized.  I like it.  A little too saturated for my eyes, even in its stylization.  But I really like that you had a sort of fine-art vision in mind.', '2005-11-03 18:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836447, 251629, 42845, '<td valign="top">You deserve a medal for bravery.</td>', 'You deserve a medal for bravery.', '2005-11-03 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836453, 251942, 42845, '<td valign="top">What''s the story behind this?</td>', 'What''s the story behind this?', '2005-11-03 18:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836454, 251973, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice, love the crisp colors. Water drops are a plus.</td>', 'Very nice, love the crisp colors. Water drops are a plus.', '2005-11-03 18:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836456, 252471, 42638, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Very busy picture. The colors are a bit drab but still very nice setting.</td>', 'Good shot. Very busy picture. The colors are a bit drab but still very nice setting.', '2005-11-03 18:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836470, 252151, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice busy picture but is a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Wow, very nice busy picture but is a bit out of focus.', '2005-11-03 18:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836474, 252497, 42845, '<td valign="top">I really like it, but it seems dead calm.</td>', 'I really like it, but it seems dead calm.', '2005-11-03 18:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836475, 250992, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture, nice interpretation. Great detail/texture from the skin. Nice use of space.</td>', 'Very interesting picture, nice interpretation. Great detail/texture from the skin. Nice use of space.', '2005-11-03 18:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836479, 250224, 42638, '<td valign="top">Looks like a town I know, will have to check...Too funny!! Love the whole construction scene, yet not a construction worker in sight.  Good use of space, I would probabily bump up the color just a tad.</td>', 'Looks like a town I know, will have to check...Too funny!! Love the whole construction scene, yet not a construction worker in sight.  Good use of space, I would probabily bump up the color just a tad.', '2005-11-03 18:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836484, 252497, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. The reflection and B&amp;W really adds to the sense of "Busy". Nice job</td>', 'Very nice picture. The reflection and B&W really adds to the sense of "Busy". Nice job', '2005-11-03 18:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836488, 251701, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Beautiful colors. Love the touch of green in here. Nice details.</td>', 'Wow, Beautiful colors. Love the touch of green in here. Nice details.', '2005-11-03 18:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836493, 252439, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the lines and the sky is wonderful.</td>', 'Very nice. Love the lines and the sky is wonderful.', '2005-11-03 18:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836497, 251925, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Definately a photograhers nightmare!! Great lines, The B&amp;W really add to the sense of "Busy".  Nice!</td>', 'Wow, Definately a photograhers nightmare!! Great lines, The B&W really add to the sense of "Busy".  Nice!', '2005-11-03 18:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836501, 252065, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Lots of things to focus on here. Good use of space. Great color. I really like how the glare on the ground adds to this picture.</td>', 'Very nice, Lots of things to focus on here. Good use of space. Great color. I really like how the glare on the ground adds to this picture.', '2005-11-03 18:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836502, 252319, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good detail, very clear.</td>', 'Very nice, good detail, very clear.', '2005-11-03 18:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836506, 251704, 42845, '<td valign="top">I like the light, monotone color against the shock of orange from his t-shirt and red from his lips.  I also like  the cropping.<br/></td>', 'I like the light, monotone color against the shock of orange from his t-shirt and red from his lips.  I also like  the cropping.', '2005-11-03 18:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836510, 252454, 42845, '<td valign="top">I love the choice of subject matter (though I realize it''s someone''s trajedy, it''s still beautiful), the depth of field, and color.</td>', 'I love the choice of subject matter (though I realize it''s someone''s trajedy, it''s still beautiful), the depth of field, and color.', '2005-11-03 18:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836554, 252503, 45857, '<td valign="top">Incredible macro shot. You could count the ''hair'' on its legs, not that I''d care to.<br/></td>', 'Incredible macro shot. You could count the ''hair'' on its legs, not that I''d care to.', '2005-11-03 18:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836556, 252336, 44829, '<td valign="top">I am impressed!</td>', 'I am impressed!', '2005-11-03 18:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836591, 251803, 46448, '<td valign="top">Thats quite an amazing shot! I dunno if it says busy, but it does make me ask the question, what the heck is going on here?! Is the Chopper on fire? Where was the guy rescued from? Its got me busy asking questions:)</td>', 'Thats quite an amazing shot! I dunno if it says busy, but it does make me ask the question, what the heck is going on here?! Is the Chopper on fire? Where was the guy rescued from? Its got me busy asking questions:)', '2005-11-03 19:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836593, 252215, 46448, '<td valign="top">What a cool angle! I like how ya put the Depth of field on the center structure.</td>', 'What a cool angle! I like how ya put the Depth of field on the center structure.', '2005-11-03 19:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836596, 252417, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept. Love the coloring and the reflections of light on them all, its just the right amount. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice concept. Love the coloring and the reflections of light on them all, its just the right amount. Good job.', '2005-11-03 19:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836598, 252166, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice. Love the use of space and the lines of lights. Helicopter is definate bonus!!</td>', 'Wow, very nice. Love the use of space and the lines of lights. Helicopter is definate bonus!!', '2005-11-03 19:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836610, 252212, 45857, '<td valign="top">Wonderful montage of colors, angles and textures.  You present an interesting dichotomy with the idle waitress and empty cafe. Your picture might not score as well since some will think of it as a non-busy focal point, instead of a contrast that emphasis''s the busy cityscape.</td>', 'Wonderful montage of colors, angles and textures.  You present an interesting dichotomy with the idle waitress and empty cafe. Your picture might not score as well since some will think of it as a non-busy focal point, instead of a contrast that emphasis''s the busy cityscape.', '2005-11-03 19:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836619, 252142, 45857, '<td valign="top">Its simply a pleasure to look at this photo. There a certain quality that reminds me of the Flemish or Dutch masters.</td>', 'Its simply a pleasure to look at this photo. There a certain quality that reminds me of the Flemish or Dutch masters.', '2005-11-03 19:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836628, 252422, 45857, '<td valign="top">A strong photojournalistic image, certainly enigmatic.</td>', 'A strong photojournalistic image, certainly enigmatic.', '2005-11-03 19:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836641, 252212, 35602, '<td valign="top">The busiest photo I''ve seen.  Love the composition on this one.  It had a bad balance of light and dark, though.  Perhaps some fill in flash might have given the foreground a bit more light to balance the hazy background.  Still, an excellent photo.</td>', 'The busiest photo I''ve seen.  Love the composition on this one.  It had a bad balance of light and dark, though.  Perhaps some fill in flash might have given the foreground a bit more light to balance the hazy background.  Still, an excellent photo.', '2005-11-03 19:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836646, 251257, 35602, '<td valign="top">Boy you got that one right.  Loved the colors on this one.  Nice detail.</td>', 'Boy you got that one right.  Loved the colors on this one.  Nice detail.', '2005-11-03 19:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836649, 252424, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I run a frame shop too.  It can definitely be very busy.  Anyway, the focus is a little soft on this one, and I think that the dark door frame to the left of the photo is distracting.  Perhaps open doors would have made a better composition.</td>', 'Very nice.  I run a frame shop too.  It can definitely be very busy.  Anyway, the focus is a little soft on this one, and I think that the dark door frame to the left of the photo is distracting.  Perhaps open doors would have made a better composition.', '2005-11-03 19:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836651, 252227, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot, especially for the Challenge.  Toning works very well.  Criticism; apologies if wrong, but seems needs a slight nudge up on the left side - isn''t quite ''symmetrical''.  Really like the effect achieved here, especially ''using'' this scene, and the two gentlemen parked near the fountain add a good sense of ''stop'' to this shot.</td>', '7 - Good shot, especially for the Challenge.  Toning works very well.  Criticism; apologies if wrong, but seems needs a slight nudge up on the left side - isn''t quite ''symmetrical''.  Really like the effect achieved here, especially ''using'' this scene, and the two gentlemen parked near the fountain add a good sense of ''stop'' to this shot.', '2005-11-03 19:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836653, 251793, 45857, '<td valign="top">Really cute funny picture, very clever idea that I''m certain will be a conversation piece for many years to come.</td>', 'Really cute funny picture, very clever idea that I''m certain will be a conversation piece for many years to come.', '2005-11-03 19:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836654, 252277, 35602, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Mystic Seaport in Connecticut.  I love the depth of this one,  but I think a bit more cropping might have really brought out the rigging.</td>', 'Reminds me of Mystic Seaport in Connecticut.  I love the depth of this one,  but I think a bit more cropping might have really brought out the rigging.', '2005-11-03 19:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836656, 249781, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot, the better of the ''busy bees'' in my opinion.  Criticism; if possible, a slightly tighter crop, especially eliminating that dark area bottom left, and also placing the bee ''off centre'' may have made this better in my opinion.  Like to see the bee ''sharper'', more defined, but I know how difficult it is - good wing capture though.  Not sure on the coloring, but especially the tinting in the wings and the orange pollen, if you had changed the colors or ''toning'', would likely have lost that so not sure.</td>', '7 - Good shot, the better of the ''busy bees'' in my opinion.  Criticism; if possible, a slightly tighter crop, especially eliminating that dark area bottom left, and also placing the bee ''off centre'' may have made this better in my opinion.  Like to see the bee ''sharper'', more defined, but I know how difficult it is - good wing capture though.  Not sure on the coloring, but especially the tinting in the wings and the orange pollen, if you had changed the colors or ''toning'', would likely have lost that so not sure.', '2005-11-03 19:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836660, 251398, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good idea.  Toning works well.  Criticism; in a shot like this the symmetry needs to be spot on in my opinion, and it seems that this needs a slightly tighter crop and possibly a nudge rotation up on the left.  A little more ''definition'' in the tools, etc, may also have made this beter in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame, but think it does ''add to the feel'' in this shot.</td>', '7 - Good idea.  Toning works well.  Criticism; in a shot like this the symmetry needs to be spot on in my opinion, and it seems that this needs a slightly tighter crop and possibly a nudge rotation up on the left.  A little more ''definition'' in the tools, etc, may also have made this beter in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame, but think it does ''add to the feel'' in this shot.', '2005-11-03 19:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836661, 250632, 45857, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull  assortment of colors and actions</td>', 'Wonderfull  assortment of colors and actions', '2005-11-03 19:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836663, 252471, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot and coloring.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a slightly tighter crop at the bottom/fore but that grass/seedheads(?) add a good element in my opinion so not sure.</td>', '7 - Good shot and coloring.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a slightly tighter crop at the bottom/fore but that grass/seedheads(?) add a good element in my opinion so not sure.', '2005-11-03 19:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836664, 252212, 29904, '<td valign="top">feels tipped to the left.  But otherwise very nice! 7</td>', 'feels tipped to the left.  But otherwise very nice! 7', '2005-11-03 19:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836670, 252503, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Oh, good shot, good coloring.  Nice macro(?).  Good ''catch'' for the Challenge.  Really like the way you captured the ''leg work'' here.  Criticism; more detail somehow (tighter crop perhaps, but then you lose the perspective) on those legs ''working'', may have made this even better in my opinion.  Like the composition - with the ''diagonal'' using the web and ''whiteness'', etc.</td>', '8 - Oh, good shot, good coloring.  Nice macro(?).  Good ''catch'' for the Challenge.  Really like the way you captured the ''leg work'' here.  Criticism; more detail somehow (tighter crop perhaps, but then you lose the perspective) on those legs ''working'', may have made this even better in my opinion.  Like the composition - with the ''diagonal'' using the web and ''whiteness'', etc.', '2005-11-03 19:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
