(1837301, 252092, 45857, '<td valign="top">And I thought it was idle hands that were the devils workshop....</td>', 'And I thought it was idle hands that were the devils workshop....', '2005-11-04 01:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837412, 250527, 45857, '<td valign="top">You display a frightfully awesome talent. Outside of the context of this challenge, this is a masterpiece. As a challenge entry, I don''t think its the best interpretation of busy, too subjective, within the mind of your subject. 8<br/>(edit: Wife said "give it a 10, you stupid putz")  10</td>', 'You display a frightfully awesome talent. Outside of the context of this challenge, this is a masterpiece. As a challenge entry, I don''t think its the best interpretation of busy, too subjective, within the mind of your subject. 8(edit: Wife said "give it a 10, you stupid putz")  10', '2005-11-04 04:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837413, 252195, 45962, '<td valign="top">Angle you shoot is very nice because able strongly show escalator shapes. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-16 22:40:46.</i></td>', 'Angle you shoot is very nice because able strongly show escalator shapes. ', '2005-11-04 05:01:48.000000', '2005-11-16 22:40:46.000000', 1),
(1837570, 251400, 42845, '<td valign="top">Great color without overdoing it.  And whether the boys are posed or not, the shot looks candid, which I think makes it a nice slice of childhood rather than turning it into something schmaltzy.  Way to go.</td>', 'Great color without overdoing it.  And whether the boys are posed or not, the shot looks candid, which I think makes it a nice slice of childhood rather than turning it into something schmaltzy.  Way to go.', '2005-11-04 08:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837574, 251992, 42845, '<td valign="top">I like the busyness of the pattern set againsts the orderly repetition of the wood and the large sort of restful areas of black.  Really nice composition, I think.</td>', 'I like the busyness of the pattern set againsts the orderly repetition of the wood and the large sort of restful areas of black.  Really nice composition, I think.', '2005-11-04 08:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837581, 251883, 42845, '<td valign="top">I can see that you laid everything meticulously out, and you even made a game out of your photo, which I think is great.  But I don''t think it''s visually appealing enough for me to want to look long enough to play.</td>', 'I can see that you laid everything meticulously out, and you even made a game out of your photo, which I think is great.  But I don''t think it''s visually appealing enough for me to want to look long enough to play.', '2005-11-04 08:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837582, 251400, 26633, '<td valign="top">I hate pictures of children :(<br/>But I voted 10 for the Blue Ribbon in Delicate ... so maybe you''ll do well ...<br/>Action, colour, composition, timing, you''ve got everything here. 10 of course.</td>', 'I hate pictures of children :(But I voted 10 for the Blue Ribbon in Delicate ... so maybe you''ll do well ...Action, colour, composition, timing, you''ve got everything here. 10 of course.', '2005-11-04 08:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837583, 252406, 42845, '<td valign="top">I think the saturation is too high, especially with a white sky, but the composition is nice.</td>', 'I think the saturation is too high, especially with a white sky, but the composition is nice.', '2005-11-04 08:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837584, 251849, 40054, '<td valign="top">remarkable image</td>', 'remarkable image', '2005-11-04 08:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837593, 250753, 42845, '<td valign="top">I like the picture without the dewy stalk --  it bisects the picture unnaturally and looks as though you''re holding it yourself; and the water droplets seem gimmicky.  I mean, nothing else is dewy.  But I really love the leaf in the foreground that leads to the one that''s out of focus in the background.  That was nice.</td>', 'I like the picture without the dewy stalk --  it bisects the picture unnaturally and looks as though you''re holding it yourself; and the water droplets seem gimmicky.  I mean, nothing else is dewy.  But I really love the leaf in the foreground that leads to the one that''s out of focus in the background.  That was nice.', '2005-11-04 09:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837602, 252492, 42845, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the repetition of orange -- from the pumpkin, to whatever that is on the left, to the tree up top -- as well as with the gray.  Good depth of field.  The twig is annoying, but who can help those things?  And her half-smile with just the two front teeth showing really completes the mouse look.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the repetition of orange -- from the pumpkin, to whatever that is on the left, to the tree up top -- as well as with the gray.  Good depth of field.  The twig is annoying, but who can help those things?  And her half-smile with just the two front teeth showing really completes the mouse look.', '2005-11-04 09:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837605, 249676, 42845, '<td valign="top">Hooray for you for taking a chance.  There are a couple of distracting elements:  the tank(?) in the background and that redish reflection (?).  But I think the effect is so strong that they really don''t matter on the whole.</td>', 'Hooray for you for taking a chance.  There are a couple of distracting elements:  the tank(?) in the background and that redish reflection (?).  But I think the effect is so strong that they really don''t matter on the whole.', '2005-11-04 09:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837608, 249812, 42845, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of the rose, but I don''t get how it''s busy.</td>', 'Nice picture of the rose, but I don''t get how it''s busy.', '2005-11-04 09:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837611, 250359, 37524, '<td valign="top">Love this!</td>', 'Love this!', '2005-11-04 09:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837613, 252503, 37524, '<td valign="top">Great Perspective, and texture.</td>', 'Great Perspective, and texture.', '2005-11-04 09:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837646, 251301, 42845, '<td valign="top">It''s a really nice picture, especially with the almost blown-out highlights of the outside framed by both the windows of the tractor and the sort of lattice work of the beams.  But without the title it''s just a picture of a stationary machine.  I don''t think pictures should be completely dependent upon their title unless the title reveals some bit of irony or a satirical note that claries why the picture fits, not makes the picture fit.</td>', 'It''s a really nice picture, especially with the almost blown-out highlights of the outside framed by both the windows of the tractor and the sort of lattice work of the beams.  But without the title it''s just a picture of a stationary machine.  I don''t think pictures should be completely dependent upon their title unless the title reveals some bit of irony or a satirical note that claries why the picture fits, not makes the picture fit.', '2005-11-04 09:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837650, 252451, 42845, '<td valign="top">I think maybe taking the picture from eye level (his) would have worked better for me.  It may have eliminated some of the asphalt and made the picture more intimate.  As it is, it''s a little too precious for me.</td>', 'I think maybe taking the picture from eye level (his) would have worked better for me.  It may have eliminated some of the asphalt and made the picture more intimate.  As it is, it''s a little too precious for me.', '2005-11-04 09:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837658, 250984, 42845, '<td valign="top">The leaves certainly are busy, but the focus on the waterdragon seems off.  I''m not a focus freak, but the waterdragon is the main focus of your picture with all the sort of ancillary leaves cluttering in around him/her, so I feel like he/she should really be in focus.</td>', 'The leaves certainly are busy, but the focus on the waterdragon seems off.  I''m not a focus freak, but the waterdragon is the main focus of your picture with all the sort of ancillary leaves cluttering in around him/her, so I feel like he/she should really be in focus.', '2005-11-04 10:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837664, 252212, 42845, '<td valign="top">I see the urban but not the chaos.  The graffiti is chaoitic, I guess, but the buildings in the background seem very orderly as they step their way up to castle or fortress atop the hill.  I really like the picture as a whole, with the steps in the foreground leading down and the buildings in the background leading up, but I don''t see busyness.</td>', 'I see the urban but not the chaos.  The graffiti is chaoitic, I guess, but the buildings in the background seem very orderly as they step their way up to castle or fortress atop the hill.  I really like the picture as a whole, with the steps in the foreground leading down and the buildings in the background leading up, but I don''t see busyness.', '2005-11-04 10:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1837668, 252151, 42845, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the soft focus (caused by movement?) of the pasta, but combined with the graininess and sort of flat color, it gives the overall effect of mush.</td>', 'I don''t mind the soft focus (caused by movement?) of the pasta, but combined with the graininess and sort of flat color, it gives the overall effect of mush.', '2005-11-04 10:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
