(1838132, 251410, 46177, '<td valign="top">Sorry the face does not really look to me like the gentleman is busy, it somehow just looks blurry.  It was a good idea though.</td>', 'Sorry the face does not really look to me like the gentleman is busy, it somehow just looks blurry.  It was a good idea though.', '2005-11-04 13:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838133, 252151, 46177, '<td valign="top">Just a little to out of focus, good idea though. 4</td>', 'Just a little to out of focus, good idea though. 4', '2005-11-04 13:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838137, 252056, 46177, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the picture to show busy hands however for me the photo lacks interest, in colour or composition.  There seems to be no focal point or any areas of interest, the colour is bland and so is the crop.  Sorry sometimes I feel its hard to remember it also needs to be visually appealing along with meeting the challenge.</td>', 'I like the idea of the picture to show busy hands however for me the photo lacks interest, in colour or composition.  There seems to be no focal point or any areas of interest, the colour is bland and so is the crop.  Sorry sometimes I feel its hard to remember it also needs to be visually appealing along with meeting the challenge.', '2005-11-04 14:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838145, 252479, 46177, '<td valign="top">This is not a visually appealing or interesting image for me, it also seems a little out of focus. Perhaps I am just missing the point, I am sorry to comment without leaving any areas I might improve.</td>', 'This is not a visually appealing or interesting image for me, it also seems a little out of focus. Perhaps I am just missing the point, I am sorry to comment without leaving any areas I might improve.', '2005-11-04 14:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
