(1838150, 252495, 37444, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this was done (paper cutouts?), but i love it! 10</td>', 'Not sure how this was done (paper cutouts?), but i love it! 10', '2005-11-04 14:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838151, 251858, 37444, '<td valign="top">Great use of the OOF foreground! 9</td>', 'Great use of the OOF foreground! 9', '2005-11-04 14:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838152, 251189, 46177, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if you had taken a wall with many of these tiles it would have met the challenge more appropriatly as it is, to me anyway, you have taken a picture of one tile with a lot going on in it. So to me this is a picture of a picture. The background blends in with it to much for my taste and there is no one point of interest.</td>', 'Perhaps if you had taken a wall with many of these tiles it would have met the challenge more appropriatly as it is, to me anyway, you have taken a picture of one tile with a lot going on in it. So to me this is a picture of a picture. The background blends in with it to much for my taste and there is no one point of interest.', '2005-11-04 14:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838158, 250715, 46177, '<td valign="top">I do generally like selective desaturation however here it doesn''t really work for me.  The one bright green area in the middle of the picture seems to be to small to make sense of it and the purple off to the sides also ends up being a little off balance.  Maybe the pink blossems could have stood out more to create more interest, as it was it took me a minute to realize they were pink.</td>', 'I do generally like selective desaturation however here it doesn''t really work for me.  The one bright green area in the middle of the picture seems to be to small to make sense of it and the purple off to the sides also ends up being a little off balance.  Maybe the pink blossems could have stood out more to create more interest, as it was it took me a minute to realize they were pink.', '2005-11-04 14:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838159, 252063, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice picture however not sure it depicts busy well.</td>', 'Nice picture however not sure it depicts busy well.', '2005-11-04 14:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838164, 251701, 44860, '<td valign="top">You are not among those dying from self-consciousness? :) Anyway, I like this photo - its colors and business. Composition isn''t bad as well... :) ...8</td>', 'You are not among those dying from self-consciousness? :) Anyway, I like this photo - its colors and business. Composition isn''t bad as well... :) ...8', '2005-11-04 14:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
