(1838225, 252348, 45926, '<td valign="top">wow, very pretty. the contrasting colors work well together. i love how you can see the veins on the leaf. just wish that other parts of the picture were less out of focus. but that''s probably the effect u wanted. but it still is awesome . great job!</td>', 'wow, very pretty. the contrasting colors work well together. i love how you can see the veins on the leaf. just wish that other parts of the picture were less out of focus. but that''s probably the effect u wanted. but it still is awesome . great job!', '2005-11-04 14:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
