(1838568, 252498, 44172, '<td valign="top">LOL - this makes me think of the "What?!" challenge for sure - not sure about how "Busy" he is - looks like he''s tired out or on a break or something and in my opinion his face could have more clarity or more focus - the overall image itself leaves me wondering a bunch though - how did those leaves get inside? why is his face painted like a clown? why is he sweeping those leaves? why does he look so sad? and where are his shoes? maybe that is why he he is sad...he lost his shoes! - so overall - a pretty good composition to provoke so much thought - good job :)</td>', 'LOL - this makes me think of the "What?!" challenge for sure - not sure about how "Busy" he is - looks like he''s tired out or on a break or something and in my opinion his face could have more clarity or more focus - the overall image itself leaves me wondering a bunch though - how did those leaves get inside? why is his face painted like a clown? why is he sweeping those leaves? why does he look so sad? and where are his shoes? maybe that is why he he is sad...he lost his shoes! - so overall - a pretty good composition to provoke so much thought - good job :)', '2005-11-04 16:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
