(1838576, 252139, 44829, '<td valign="top">this is not so busy.</td>', 'this is not so busy.', '2005-11-04 16:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838582, 252058, 44829, '<td valign="top">Great busy colours. Pity it looks a bit grainy.</td>', 'Great busy colours. Pity it looks a bit grainy.', '2005-11-04 16:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838593, 251837, 44829, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites. Great pic!!</td>', 'One of my favourites. Great pic!!', '2005-11-04 16:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838637, 251931, 26633, '<td valign="top">This is one of those pictures that makes me forget I''m looking at pixels. So much action and detail. It deserves re-shooting on film :) ... 10 from me.</td>', 'This is one of those pictures that makes me forget I''m looking at pixels. So much action and detail. It deserves re-shooting on film :) ... 10 from me.', '2005-11-04 17:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838640, 252406, 21422, '<td valign="top">Nice color and good job of framing. 10</td>', 'Nice color and good job of framing. 10', '2005-11-04 17:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838641, 251530, 21422, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to be lacking color.  There is nothing that really jumps out at me on this shot.</td>', 'This shot seems to be lacking color.  There is nothing that really jumps out at me on this shot.', '2005-11-04 17:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838644, 251449, 21422, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in this shot.  The DOF is good too.</td>', 'Nice contrast in this shot.  The DOF is good too.', '2005-11-04 17:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838651, 250770, 21422, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I am not sure what to say on this shot.  Either too much post processing with blur filter or just out of focus.  I might have scored it higher if the hand was at least in focus</td>', 'Hmm, I am not sure what to say on this shot.  Either too much post processing with blur filter or just out of focus.  I might have scored it higher if the hand was at least in focus', '2005-11-04 17:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838683, 252192, 44172, '<td valign="top">I like this - a very clean capture, nice lighting and love the blur of the people - busy indeed and meets the challenge real well - good job :)</td>', 'I like this - a very clean capture, nice lighting and love the blur of the people - busy indeed and meets the challenge real well - good job :)', '2005-11-04 17:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838685, 250962, 44172, '<td valign="top">great ground up image, lines are real "busy" so it meets the challenge, like the perspective and how it gets more "busy" the further up it goes - good job :)</td>', 'great ground up image, lines are real "busy" so it meets the challenge, like the perspective and how it gets more "busy" the further up it goes - good job :)', '2005-11-04 17:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838690, 250224, 44172, '<td valign="top">I had the same idea of capturing some traffic but I couldn''t execute it as well as you :) - I wanted to have a few lanes of traffic - but obviously with the cones and all here - you had found traffic with construction - I''m wondering how this might have been in black and white and if I might like that better, and also a slightly thinner border - all my opinion - you obviously met the challenge - good job!</td>', 'I had the same idea of capturing some traffic but I couldn''t execute it as well as you :) - I wanted to have a few lanes of traffic - but obviously with the cones and all here - you had found traffic with construction - I''m wondering how this might have been in black and white and if I might like that better, and also a slightly thinner border - all my opinion - you obviously met the challenge - good job!', '2005-11-04 18:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838705, 252286, 44172, '<td valign="top">lots of birds making this sky real "busy" - so it meets the challenge - good job :) my opinion of this image overall is that I''m not sure that I like the sepia or brownish tone, also not sure about the crop or layout - it''s a teeny bit distracting how some of the birds are cut off as well as the bunches of leaves, also - I notice a bit of noise around all of the birds and leaves - and I have this same problem with all of my images - I''m wondering what we are doing wrong? Anyhow - those are my thoughts, like I said, it meets the challenge - so good job!</td>', 'lots of birds making this sky real "busy" - so it meets the challenge - good job :) my opinion of this image overall is that I''m not sure that I like the sepia or brownish tone, also not sure about the crop or layout - it''s a teeny bit distracting how some of the birds are cut off as well as the bunches of leaves, also - I notice a bit of noise around all of the birds and leaves - and I have this same problem with all of my images - I''m wondering what we are doing wrong? Anyhow - those are my thoughts, like I said, it meets the challenge - so good job!', '2005-11-04 18:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838727, 250570, 42792, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Too bad it''s quite obvious there are only 2 people.  Same effect in a more crowded space would have been more powerful.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Too bad it''s quite obvious there are only 2 people.  Same effect in a more crowded space would have been more powerful.', '2005-11-04 18:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838743, 250710, 42792, '<td valign="top">Some nice colours but not sure that the composition here really works.  It''s busy alright but the composition looks careless and I stress "looks".  To me the challenge is to make something busy have photo appeal.</td>', 'Some nice colours but not sure that the composition here really works.  It''s busy alright but the composition looks careless and I stress "looks".  To me the challenge is to make something busy have photo appeal.', '2005-11-04 18:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838766, 252440, 42792, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell where the focus is.  In fact, it looks a little blur all round.  The composition could be better maybe by moving a little more to the left to take out the dark parts on the left.</td>', 'Can''t tell where the focus is.  In fact, it looks a little blur all round.  The composition could be better maybe by moving a little more to the left to take out the dark parts on the left.', '2005-11-04 18:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838777, 252350, 42792, '<td valign="top">Different point of view and why not.  I would prefer a little more contrast tho.  The grey all round looks a tad flat.</td>', 'Different point of view and why not.  I would prefer a little more contrast tho.  The grey all round looks a tad flat.', '2005-11-04 18:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838778, 251942, 40226, '<td valign="top">Busy?  This is way worse than busy.  Haunting. yes!</td>', 'Busy?  This is way worse than busy.  Haunting. yes!', '2005-11-04 18:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838785, 251391, 42792, '<td valign="top">A nice static postcare shot but the lack of human activity takes away what you''re trying to convey as "busy".</td>', 'A nice static postcare shot but the lack of human activity takes away what you''re trying to convey as "busy".', '2005-11-04 18:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1838787, 252212, 40226, '<td valign="top">Waiting for busy?</td>', 'Waiting for busy?', '2005-11-04 18:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
