(1839436, 252423, 44172, '<td valign="top">LOL - good image, title, idea - meets challenge and I do especially like the pattern of all the yellow flower centers on this one - good job :)</td>', 'LOL - good image, title, idea - meets challenge and I do especially like the pattern of all the yellow flower centers on this one - good job :)', '2005-11-04 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
