(1839898, 251410, 18450, '<td valign="top">Really like the concept in this shot. Would love to see how it would have worked in b/w, for me when I''m looking at it I''m seeing more the colour, not the action. Image could have been a little larger using the full 640pixels/150 kbs allowed. Good, creative idea!</td>', 'Really like the concept in this shot. Would love to see how it would have worked in b/w, for me when I''m looking at it I''m seeing more the colour, not the action. Image could have been a little larger using the full 640pixels/150 kbs allowed. Good, creative idea!', '2005-11-05 06:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1839899, 252142, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot showing the total absorbtion of children when they''re ''busy''. Nice compostition!</td>', 'Lovely shot showing the total absorbtion of children when they''re ''busy''. Nice compostition!', '2005-11-05 06:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1839900, 251803, 18450, '<td valign="top">WOW!! What an amazing shot!! Great timing.....superb shot!</td>', 'WOW!! What an amazing shot!! Great timing.....superb shot!', '2005-11-05 06:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1839910, 251791, 42792, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where the focus is nor what the subject is with this photo.  Despite the title, I only see 2 dots that look vaguely like birds.  The tree does nothing except confuse the viewer on the subject.  There''s a fair amount of noise in the sky and the light is really nothing great.  Overall, it just looks like an accidental test shot that got submitted by mistake.  Challenge-wise, it''s way off.  If you really wanted to show "busy" birds flying, capturing a whole flock would be better.  If not possible, another idea would probably be better but only you can think of that.  Sorry if this sounds harsh but it''s meant to help as this was the lowest score I''ve given so far in this challenge.</td>', 'I don''t know where the focus is nor what the subject is with this photo.  Despite the title, I only see 2 dots that look vaguely like birds.  The tree does nothing except confuse the viewer on the subject.  There''s a fair amount of noise in the sky and the light is really nothing great.  Overall, it just looks like an accidental test shot that got submitted by mistake.  Challenge-wise, it''s way off.  If you really wanted to show "busy" birds flying, capturing a whole flock would be better.  If not possible, another idea would probably be better but only you can think of that.  Sorry if this sounds harsh but it''s meant to help as this was the lowest score I''ve given so far in this challenge.', '2005-11-05 06:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1839918, 250450, 42792, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a hint of some very nice textures and also colours but unfortunately these weren''t presented to advantage.  A little more adjustments in saturation or levels might have improved it.  Another thing that doesn''t help is the lack of a focal point.  I''m not exactly sure where my eye is supposed to be drawn to.  If all areas were equally sharp, this would not have been a problem but the blur on multiple spots makes it seem like there should be a focus somewhere which is not the case.  Hope this helps.</td>', 'There seems to be a hint of some very nice textures and also colours but unfortunately these weren''t presented to advantage.  A little more adjustments in saturation or levels might have improved it.  Another thing that doesn''t help is the lack of a focal point.  I''m not exactly sure where my eye is supposed to be drawn to.  If all areas were equally sharp, this would not have been a problem but the blur on multiple spots makes it seem like there should be a focus somewhere which is not the case.  Hope this helps.', '2005-11-05 06:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1839923, 252326, 42792, '<td valign="top">Very nice warm colours.  Just find it too soft overall, including the interpretation on busy.  It can be a pretty picture by itself once it''s sharpened a tad more but not for this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice warm colours.  Just find it too soft overall, including the interpretation on busy.  It can be a pretty picture by itself once it''s sharpened a tad more but not for this challenge.', '2005-11-05 07:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1840064, 252457, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very cool!   Perfect for the Transparency challenge too.    I love the vibrant colors.</td>', 'Very cool!   Perfect for the Transparency challenge too.    I love the vibrant colors.', '2005-11-05 09:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1840100, 252020, 44172, '<td valign="top">Like the title and the border and the use of the blue coloring - not sure if I would have liked to see this a little more in focus and crisper - I think overall the soft focus works very well. Too bad all of the chairs in the salon weren''t filled to really give the impression of "busy" - the brightness at the bottom is a teeny bit distracting. Overall it''s a nice composition and meets the challenge - good job :)</td>', 'Like the title and the border and the use of the blue coloring - not sure if I would have liked to see this a little more in focus and crisper - I think overall the soft focus works very well. Too bad all of the chairs in the salon weren''t filled to really give the impression of "busy" - the brightness at the bottom is a teeny bit distracting. Overall it''s a nice composition and meets the challenge - good job :)', '2005-11-05 10:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1840218, 252058, 21362, '<td valign="top">This would be great if it was actually full of people. But it really doesn''t look that busy inside. I like the colors and the POV with the wide open doors just inviting the viewer into the photo.</td>', 'This would be great if it was actually full of people. But it really doesn''t look that busy inside. I like the colors and the POV with the wide open doors just inviting the viewer into the photo.', '2005-11-05 11:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
