(1842266, 252444, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I am assuming there is color in the drawings.  I was wondering why you chose to ignore it.  Would it have not added to the business of the drawings? None-the-less, I love the rich tones of your black and white. . . especially on the young lady. BOL  7</td>', 'Nicely done.  I am assuming there is color in the drawings.  I was wondering why you chose to ignore it.  Would it have not added to the business of the drawings? None-the-less, I love the rich tones of your black and white. . . especially on the young lady. BOL  7', '2005-11-06 14:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1842270, 250710, 40484, '<td valign="top">What a great riot of colours! IMO, I would have liked to see a sharper focus on perhaps the grasses in the foreground. Be careful of blown highlights when you are post-processing.</td>', 'What a great riot of colours! IMO, I would have liked to see a sharper focus on perhaps the grasses in the foreground. Be careful of blown highlights when you are post-processing.', '2005-11-06 14:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
