(1842448, 250450, 42845, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be enough depth of field, which isn''t necessarily bad; but here I can''t tell that the shallow depth of field is not unintentional because it doesn''t seem to add anything to the picture.  The pattern of the leaves and the fence is busy, but it isn''t particularly creative.  But I like the use of color, especially against the black background behind the chain link fence.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be enough depth of field, which isn''t necessarily bad; but here I can''t tell that the shallow depth of field is not unintentional because it doesn''t seem to add anything to the picture.  The pattern of the leaves and the fence is busy, but it isn''t particularly creative.  But I like the use of color, especially against the black background behind the chain link fence.', '2005-11-06 16:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
