(1846321, 252174, 46468, '<td valign="top">First thought when I looked at this photo was a calm  landscape, once I read the title then the wires became more apparent.  For this to have worked better, IMO, the wires and the towers need to stand out more, they are lost in the gray looking sky. Also the focus on them especially should be sharper.</td>', 'First thought when I looked at this photo was a calm  landscape, once I read the title then the wires became more apparent.  For this to have worked better, IMO, the wires and the towers need to stand out more, they are lost in the gray looking sky. Also the focus on them especially should be sharper.', '2005-11-07 23:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
