(1846850, 252490, 46806, '<td valign="top">Before this picture even started loading, I wanted to rate it a 1, but that is because I am so repulsed by the subject, I''m all for christmas, but this sort of stuff is just ugly to me.  But then after thinking about it, the concept seems pretty creative, and does conjure up a sense of "busy"ness, so in that respect the photograph is succesful even if I find it personally unpleasant.  Rated 7.</td>', 'Before this picture even started loading, I wanted to rate it a 1, but that is because I am so repulsed by the subject, I''m all for christmas, but this sort of stuff is just ugly to me.  But then after thinking about it, the concept seems pretty creative, and does conjure up a sense of "busy"ness, so in that respect the photograph is succesful even if I find it personally unpleasant.  Rated 7.', '2005-11-08 07:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846852, 252505, 46468, '<td valign="top">definately "busy" people, IMO, it would have looked even busier if the guy would not have taken the time to try to block his face. The women are too busy to even pay attention to the camera.</td>', 'definately "busy" people, IMO, it would have looked even busier if the guy would not have taken the time to try to block his face. The women are too busy to even pay attention to the camera.', '2005-11-08 07:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846856, 250510, 46468, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The sky is busy and the patchwork quilt of earth looks like a busy pattern, and the uneven lighting adds to the "busy" look.</td>', 'Great capture. The sky is busy and the patchwork quilt of earth looks like a busy pattern, and the uneven lighting adds to the "busy" look.', '2005-11-08 07:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846859, 252058, 46468, '<td valign="top">Lots of colors and patterns do make this a "busy" picture. Wish it had more people visible as this would have added to the "busy" look, and some people may not take in to account all the shapes and colors and look too quickly and say the arcade is not "busy" but quiet at this time. Good luck, nice capture.</td>', 'Lots of colors and patterns do make this a "busy" picture. Wish it had more people visible as this would have added to the "busy" look, and some people may not take in to account all the shapes and colors and look too quickly and say the arcade is not "busy" but quiet at this time. Good luck, nice capture.', '2005-11-08 07:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846860, 251803, 46468, '<td valign="top">This is definately not a shot that everyone can capture everyday.  Definately meets the challenge, great capture.</td>', 'This is definately not a shot that everyone can capture everyday.  Definately meets the challenge, great capture.', '2005-11-08 07:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
