(1846891, 251803, 35602, '<td valign="top">This was a wow photo.  I know it is basic editing and you can''t do any kind of burning or dodging, but I see the photo as you can edit it without restrictions, so I give it a 10.</td>', 'This was a wow photo.  I know it is basic editing and you can''t do any kind of burning or dodging, but I see the photo as you can edit it without restrictions, so I give it a 10.', '2005-11-08 08:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846895, 252495, 35602, '<td valign="top">It must have taken hours to cut all these shapes.  For the trouble you had to put in to the photo, I give it an 8.  It is definitely very busy, though the foreground seems somewhat dark, but it could be my monitor.</td>', 'It must have taken hours to cut all these shapes.  For the trouble you had to put in to the photo, I give it an 8.  It is definitely very busy, though the foreground seems somewhat dark, but it could be my monitor.', '2005-11-08 08:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846898, 250715, 35602, '<td valign="top">Seemed overprocessed.  I am seeing some strange colors in the background light.  There is quite a bit of bad light balance here.  Perhaps an exposure compensation at the time of the shot might have helped, as well as adding a neutral density filter to balance the light better.  If your camera doesn"s allow a filter, buy one anyway and hold it in front of the camera.  It should still give the same result.</td>', 'Seemed overprocessed.  I am seeing some strange colors in the background light.  There is quite a bit of bad light balance here.  Perhaps an exposure compensation at the time of the shot might have helped, as well as adding a neutral density filter to balance the light better.  If your camera doesn"s allow a filter, buy one anyway and hold it in front of the camera.  It should still give the same result.', '2005-11-08 08:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846903, 251859, 35602, '<td valign="top">The shot seemed out of focus.</td>', 'The shot seemed out of focus.', '2005-11-08 08:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
