(1847452, 252050, 35804, '<td valign="top">I find this completely dazzling and curious...on one hand I want to know what I am looking at..."what are these baubles?" I ask myself...and then again I want to be kept in the dark to allow my imagination to take control...either way,  this is quite wonderful!</td>', 'I find this completely dazzling and curious...on one hand I want to know what I am looking at..."what are these baubles?" I ask myself...and then again I want to be kept in the dark to allow my imagination to take control...either way,  this is quite wonderful!', '2005-11-08 13:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847458, 252461, 35804, '<td valign="top">I never grow tired of these "city in motion" images, and this is no exception...very nicely done.</td>', 'I never grow tired of these "city in motion" images, and this is no exception...very nicely done.', '2005-11-08 13:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847460, 252471, 35804, '<td valign="top">Very nice...I''m in love with the motion and light...frantic yet beautiful.</td>', 'Very nice...I''m in love with the motion and light...frantic yet beautiful.', '2005-11-08 13:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847471, 252386, 35804, '<td valign="top">Exactly...there never seems to be enough space for the artist...as soon as we get some more, we seem to fill that up too...I don''t think I have ever seen a "simplified" artist''s space, life can be found in the clutter...</td>', 'Exactly...there never seems to be enough space for the artist...as soon as we get some more, we seem to fill that up too...I don''t think I have ever seen a "simplified" artist''s space, life can be found in the clutter...', '2005-11-08 13:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847483, 252227, 35804, '<td valign="top">My eye''s cannot find a moments peace looking at this...perhaps this is why I like it so much...the entire image seems to be moving...as if to say  "..you see! We cannot truly stop time!"...what a wonderful illusion you have created here!</td>', 'My eye''s cannot find a moments peace looking at this...perhaps this is why I like it so much...the entire image seems to be moving...as if to say  "..you see! We cannot truly stop time!"...what a wonderful illusion you have created here!', '2005-11-08 13:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847488, 252497, 35804, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this...there is this wonderful "echo" happening within this image...very nice.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this...there is this wonderful "echo" happening within this image...very nice.', '2005-11-08 13:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847494, 252154, 35804, '<td valign="top">What a puzzle and mystery! Now I''d like to see a picture of someone trying to remove the bike from this tangled mess of a tree...<br/> <br/>: }</td>', 'What a puzzle and mystery! Now I''d like to see a picture of someone trying to remove the bike from this tangled mess of a tree... : }', '2005-11-08 13:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847517, 252433, 44172, '<td valign="top">Very funny image and the boy''s expression is right on, I really like the title (titles matter in my opinion!) all the stuff in the junk drawer is definitely busy so it''s overall a very good fit for this challenge. I especially like the smoothness of the wood and his skin/hair in contrast to the sharpness of all the "junk" - not sure if that was on purpose - but it turned out great - very original idea - no others like it in this particular challenge - and I always like those the best! Good Job!!!</td>', 'Very funny image and the boy''s expression is right on, I really like the title (titles matter in my opinion!) all the stuff in the junk drawer is definitely busy so it''s overall a very good fit for this challenge. I especially like the smoothness of the wood and his skin/hair in contrast to the sharpness of all the "junk" - not sure if that was on purpose - but it turned out great - very original idea - no others like it in this particular challenge - and I always like those the best! Good Job!!!', '2005-11-08 13:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847540, 252280, 35496, '<td valign="top">Tthat looks like minnesota!</td>', 'Tthat looks like minnesota!', '2005-11-08 14:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847565, 252490, 44963, '<td valign="top">I liked this image.  It is a great interpretation of the challenge - busy on so many levels - and it is well taken.  It made me think of my own busy-ness to come.  No thanks for that...</td>', 'I liked this image.  It is a great interpretation of the challenge - busy on so many levels - and it is well taken.  It made me think of my own busy-ness to come.  No thanks for that...', '2005-11-08 14:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847570, 252226, 44963, '<td valign="top">This is a marvelous shot.  Colour, chaos, so much to do.  Packing it all up - damn what an effort.  I like the way the content has been arranged and you have taken the image very cleanly.  Definitely my favourite for this challenge.</td>', 'This is a marvelous shot.  Colour, chaos, so much to do.  Packing it all up - damn what an effort.  I like the way the content has been arranged and you have taken the image very cleanly.  Definitely my favourite for this challenge.', '2005-11-08 14:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
