(1847702, 252479, 47487, '<td valign="top">Without the title I would have no idea what was "busy" about this, and even knowing the title, I don''t SEE anything.  Lighting and focus could be better too. I like your idea (I think) but the execution doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'Without the title I would have no idea what was "busy" about this, and even knowing the title, I don''t SEE anything.  Lighting and focus could be better too. I like your idea (I think) but the execution doesn''t do anything for me.', '2005-11-08 15:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847704, 249819, 44754, '<td valign="top">Slightly under exposed. Also, if you could have gotten the shot without that cable or pole on the right. Other than that I like it.</td>', 'Slightly under exposed. Also, if you could have gotten the shot without that cable or pole on the right. Other than that I like it.', '2005-11-08 15:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847705, 250360, 47487, '<td valign="top">the shadows over his work are a bummer, but the look of concentration on his face is excellent.</td>', 'the shadows over his work are a bummer, but the look of concentration on his face is excellent.', '2005-11-08 15:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847714, 252425, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, but why? the focal point is a basket of napkins?  Did you use a lensbaby on this? Like I said, interesting.</td>', 'Interesting effect, but why? the focal point is a basket of napkins?  Did you use a lensbaby on this? Like I said, interesting.', '2005-11-08 15:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
