(1847938, 249781, 43400, '<td valign="top">wonderful DOF and composition--one of the best in this challenge--wish the bee was a little sharper but nonetheless, it''s a fantastic capture</td>', 'wonderful DOF and composition--one of the best in this challenge--wish the bee was a little sharper but nonetheless, it''s a fantastic capture', '2005-11-08 17:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
