(1847994, 251803, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well that''s a heckuvashot!  I''ll be interested in reading the details on this one, just to see what on earth was going on here.  Training exercise?  Stunt show?  Some guy got stuck to a helicopter?  In any case, it''s a 10 from me!</td>', 'Well that''s a heckuvashot!  I''ll be interested in reading the details on this one, just to see what on earth was going on here.  Training exercise?  Stunt show?  Some guy got stuck to a helicopter?  In any case, it''s a 10 from me!', '2005-11-08 18:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
