(1848006, 252336, 3102, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful!  Looks like the kind of place God himself would live.  Not much more I can add than that -- congrats on an incredible shot... I can''t imagine this without a ribbon in the next few hours!  - 10</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful!  Looks like the kind of place God himself would live.  Not much more I can add than that -- congrats on an incredible shot... I can''t imagine this without a ribbon in the next few hours!  - 10', '2005-11-08 18:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
