(1848326, 251189, 24981, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t think this was a good choice of subject. It''s a tile and it''s "busy", but there are many more interesting subjects in the world to photograph instead of someone''s artwork. Good luck in future challenges and I hope you don''t take this personally, but as the constructive critique as it was intended. feel free to pm me if you wish. 3</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t think this was a good choice of subject. It''s a tile and it''s "busy", but there are many more interesting subjects in the world to photograph instead of someone''s artwork. Good luck in future challenges and I hope you don''t take this personally, but as the constructive critique as it was intended. feel free to pm me if you wish. 3', '2005-11-08 20:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848328, 251837, 45802, '<td valign="top">A nice photo. I think it would look even busier if you cropped the top off at about the level of the top of the arch.</td>', 'A nice photo. I think it would look even busier if you cropped the top off at about the level of the top of the arch.', '2005-11-08 20:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848345, 252494, 24981, '<td valign="top">I do get a busy feel from this photo, so it fits the challenge. :) Wish I could see it in color.</td>', 'I do get a busy feel from this photo, so it fits the challenge. :) Wish I could see it in color.', '2005-11-08 20:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848346, 252495, 24981, '<td valign="top">Very busy, so it meets the challenge well. I like the background colors. It''s neat, but not wow to me. 6</td>', 'Very busy, so it meets the challenge well. I like the background colors. It''s neat, but not wow to me. 6', '2005-11-08 20:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848349, 251398, 24981, '<td valign="top">It''s busy alright. :) B&amp;W works for this type of photo, gives it an old-timey feel. My only gripe is the background, it takes away some of that ole-timey feel. 6</td>', 'It''s busy alright. :) B&W works for this type of photo, gives it an old-timey feel. My only gripe is the background, it takes away some of that ole-timey feel. 6', '2005-11-08 20:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848354, 252056, 24981, '<td valign="top">Dude! You gota Dell! :D<br/> <br/>Ok, you''re hands are busy, but what I see on your screen is your photo again. If you''d had a word processor or spreadsheet or something to that effect open, I''d score it 1 point higher. ;) 6</td>', 'Dude! You gota Dell! :D Ok, you''re hands are busy, but what I see on your screen is your photo again. If you''d had a word processor or spreadsheet or something to that effect open, I''d score it 1 point higher. ;) 6', '2005-11-08 20:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848360, 251915, 24981, '<td valign="top">mmmm KitKat. :) I''ll take whatcha got!<br/> <br/>Ok, it''s busy so it meets the challenge.  Looks like the lighting was done with the on-camera flash. Wish I could offer suggestions on how to make this look better, but I have no idea. sorry! 4</td>', 'mmmm KitKat. :) I''ll take whatcha got! Ok, it''s busy so it meets the challenge.  Looks like the lighting was done with the on-camera flash. Wish I could offer suggestions on how to make this look better, but I have no idea. sorry! 4', '2005-11-08 20:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848367, 250787, 24981, '<td valign="top">I like this. Very nice. I like that you can still see some of the details  and reflections on some of the building. Was this taken at sunrise or sunset? The long exposure worked great. Congrats! 10</td>', 'I like this. Very nice. I like that you can still see some of the details  and reflections on some of the building. Was this taken at sunrise or sunset? The long exposure worked great. Congrats! 10', '2005-11-08 20:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848376, 252212, 24981, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. A boost in color saturation might have brought out the roofs in the background better. Good luck! 6</td>', 'I like this shot. A boost in color saturation might have brought out the roofs in the background better. Good luck! 6', '2005-11-08 20:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848389, 252151, 24981, '<td valign="top">It''s busy, so it meets the challenge. Your focus is off though so your pic is blurry.<br/> <br/>Your pic also seems to have a fair bit of noise in it. Look for a program called "Neat Image" or look in the forums for other programs that will help clean that up. Also, if I could suggest learning how to sharpen your photos. There are a few tutorials on the site which may help you produce better quality photos.<br/> <br/>Good Luck! 3<br/> <br/>Looks delcious!</td>', 'It''s busy, so it meets the challenge. Your focus is off though so your pic is blurry. Your pic also seems to have a fair bit of noise in it. Look for a program called "Neat Image" or look in the forums for other programs that will help clean that up. Also, if I could suggest learning how to sharpen your photos. There are a few tutorials on the site which may help you produce better quality photos. Good Luck! 3 Looks delcious!', '2005-11-08 20:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848393, 251858, 24981, '<td valign="top">Oh my! This would be outstanding if the mountains in the background were more clearly defined! Love the architechure. 6</td>', 'Oh my! This would be outstanding if the mountains in the background were more clearly defined! Love the architechure. 6', '2005-11-08 21:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848400, 250954, 24981, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge well, but it''s a little small. It''s hard to see details in smaller photos. It also appears to be a bit crooked (building  and the sign with the person walking in the background lean to the right). Whatever program you used to edit this photo, check to see if you can rotate images by degrees.<br/> <br/>Good luck! 5</td>', 'This meets the challenge well, but it''s a little small. It''s hard to see details in smaller photos. It also appears to be a bit crooked (building  and the sign with the person walking in the background lean to the right). Whatever program you used to edit this photo, check to see if you can rotate images by degrees. Good luck! 5', '2005-11-08 21:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848408, 252444, 24981, '<td valign="top">Well done. 9</td>', 'Well done. 9', '2005-11-08 21:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
