(1848508, 251287, 40484, '<td valign="top">whole shot seems to have a slant to the right. perhaps a slight rotation may have helped the presentation.</td>', 'whole shot seems to have a slant to the right. perhaps a slight rotation may have helped the presentation.', '2005-11-08 22:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848564, 251189, 40484, '<td valign="top">tile is busy all right. Sorry but your shot doesn''t appeal to me. The lighting is flat and a straight on shot of the tile does not present it in a manner that provides visual interest. Perhaps a side shot with more indirect or natural lightling would have helped.</td>', 'tile is busy all right. Sorry but your shot doesn''t appeal to me. The lighting is flat and a straight on shot of the tile does not present it in a manner that provides visual interest. Perhaps a side shot with more indirect or natural lightling would have helped.', '2005-11-08 22:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848571, 250770, 40484, '<td valign="top">this may have been more effective if at least the hand held up saying stop was in focus</td>', 'this may have been more effective if at least the hand held up saying stop was in focus', '2005-11-08 22:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848588, 250059, 40484, '<td valign="top">the ladybug was hard to identify and being placed dead center does not help visually. I like the idea with the wood chips and bug. Perhaps try a different crop with the ladybug placed on a thirds intersection. The colours could also use enhancing to bring out more of the contrasts in the wood grains, maybe through level adjustment and contrast adjustment.</td>', 'the ladybug was hard to identify and being placed dead center does not help visually. I like the idea with the wood chips and bug. Perhaps try a different crop with the ladybug placed on a thirds intersection. The colours could also use enhancing to bring out more of the contrasts in the wood grains, maybe through level adjustment and contrast adjustment.', '2005-11-08 22:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848598, 250360, 40484, '<td valign="top">perhaps a closer crop to move him off centre would have helped this composition. He does look very busy concentrating on that puzzle!</td>', 'perhaps a closer crop to move him off centre would have helped this composition. He does look very busy concentrating on that puzzle!', '2005-11-08 22:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848603, 250676, 40484, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but find the focus a little too soft to make this a truly stunning photo.</td>', 'I like the composition but find the focus a little too soft to make this a truly stunning photo.', '2005-11-08 22:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848683, 251846, 39057, '<td valign="top">I like the busy bee theme...I would have cropped a little closer.</td>', 'I like the busy bee theme...I would have cropped a little closer.', '2005-11-08 22:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848694, 252195, 37893, '<td valign="top">The motion blur on this image is a great effect. I like the tonal quality of the image and just goes to show that the simplest of subjects could be a wonderful image in the end. 7</td>', 'The motion blur on this image is a great effect. I like the tonal quality of the image and just goes to show that the simplest of subjects could be a wonderful image in the end. 7', '2005-11-08 23:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
