(1848707, 249812, 37893, '<td valign="top">WOW! lovely macro. The sharpness is nicely centered and the folds in the rose is wonderfully delicate and gentle. Good capture. 7</td>', 'WOW! lovely macro. The sharpness is nicely centered and the folds in the rose is wonderfully delicate and gentle. Good capture. 7', '2005-11-08 23:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
