(1850283, 252336, 47059, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That is a gorgeous image. I want to say more, but I don''t have the words.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow!  That is a gorgeous image. I want to say more, but I don''t have the words.  Well done.', '2005-11-09 10:03:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1850329, 251166, 35357, '<td valign="top">Add me to the "people who like the tilt" camp.  Luckily for you, but unfortunately for the busy-ness of the photo, that''s not what hoity-toity urbanites would consider traffic.  A solution for this problem might be a long exposure at night, if there''s still enough traffic to load up the lanes with streaks.<br/> <br/>Keep on tilting! ;-)</td>', 'Add me to the "people who like the tilt" camp.  Luckily for you, but unfortunately for the busy-ness of the photo, that''s not what hoity-toity urbanites would consider traffic.  A solution for this problem might be a long exposure at night, if there''s still enough traffic to load up the lanes with streaks. Keep on tilting! ;-)', '2005-11-09 10:17:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1850343, 251925, 21862, '<td valign="top">oh, wow, we have something similar to that here in Dallas in the West End.  It''s not nearly as busy, but it reminds me of tihs for some reason.  This is a very neat shot.</td>', 'oh, wow, we have something similar to that here in Dallas in the West End.  It''s not nearly as busy, but it reminds me of tihs for some reason.  This is a very neat shot.', '2005-11-09 10:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
