(1850514, 251931, 5112, '<td valign="top">Thank you!<br/> <br/>@mycelium, no, this is not the same building as "a lovely industrial plant".  This one here is in Trail, British Columbia, the lovely industrial plant is close to Missoula, Montana (I think the place is called Frenchtown, you can see it driving on I-90, right past Missoula, going West).<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you! @mycelium, no, this is not the same building as "a lovely industrial plant".  This one here is in Trail, British Columbia, the lovely industrial plant is close to Missoula, Montana (I think the place is called Frenchtown, you can see it driving on I-90, right past Missoula, going West). ', '2005-11-09 11:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
