(1854290, 252503, 24951, '<td valign="top">Great angle.<br/>Ha! yes I love working close up on insects too. Was very easy to do with my A80 and close up filters - tougher with the Canon 350 and macro lens - hoping to save for accessories that allow me to get up real close again.Good luck and have fun. Congratulations on your top 5 finish.</td>', 'Great angle.Ha! yes I love working close up on insects too. Was very easy to do with my A80 and close up filters - tougher with the Canon 350 and macro lens - hoping to save for accessories that allow me to get up real close again.Good luck and have fun. Congratulations on your top 5 finish.', '2005-11-10 10:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
