(1854660, 252215, 46448, '<td valign="top">Well I think this is a great photo, <br/>I think sometimes people just speed through the voting not taking the time to study the image.<br/>I like how its focus is centered on the center one, I love the lighting effects. The only thing that I see that could have improved this photo is having the Center one in the center of the photo. I so like this one!</td>', 'Well I think this is a great photo, I think sometimes people just speed through the voting not taking the time to study the image.I like how its focus is centered on the center one, I love the lighting effects. The only thing that I see that could have improved this photo is having the Center one in the center of the photo. I so like this one!', '2005-11-10 12:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
