(1858269, 251931, 24925, '<td valign="top">This is really neat, but a little too softish for my taste...this is only personal opinion however and the image may be perfectly suited to what you had envisioned!<br/> <br/>To my eyes, a sharper, grainier look would give this a more Industrious feel.  Either way, great capture!<br/> <br/>Edit:  I just read a comment below that mentioned how the softness of the steam contrasts nicely with the sharpness of the buildings...and you know, I think I''ve been converted!  I would love to see this as a huge print, it would be gorgeous!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-11 14:00:08.</i></td>', 'This is really neat, but a little too softish for my taste...this is only personal opinion however and the image may be perfectly suited to what you had envisioned! To my eyes, a sharper, grainier look would give this a more Industrious feel.  Either way, great capture! Edit:  I just read a comment below that mentioned how the softness of the steam contrasts nicely with the sharpness of the buildings...and you know, I think I''ve been converted!  I would love to see this as a huge print, it would be gorgeous!', '2005-11-11 13:57:54.000000', '2005-11-11 14:00:08.000000', 0),
