(1902023, 251189, 42456, '<td valign="top">The picture is for the birds...pardon the pun; however, I''m going out on a limb here...busy sawing! The painting is one I wouldn''t mind putting up in my kids room. I see the painting as a portrayal of dessert animal life. I don''t see many white rabbits in the dessert though...might change the color to a hue that matches the other animals in the painting. Uh Oh...limb just broke!</td>', 'The picture is for the birds...pardon the pun; however, I''m going out on a limb here...busy sawing! The painting is one I wouldn''t mind putting up in my kids room. I see the painting as a portrayal of dessert animal life. I don''t see many white rabbits in the dessert though...might change the color to a hue that matches the other animals in the painting. Uh Oh...limb just broke!', '2005-11-28 11:11:56.000000', NULL, 0),
